# Default cue file.
#
# Loaded when the now-playing track does not match any song-specific
# file (`<artist>-<title>.cues`) in this directory. The orchestrator
# runs the default FX continuously until a matching song starts, the
# user stops the track, or the orchestrator is stopped.
#
# Customise the wash colour / intensity to taste; this is what the
# fleet does when there is no programmed show.

@bpm        120
@default_fx quiet_wash 2 5 10
